k, <span class=\"italic\">The Origin of Species</span>, after one of his voyages.", "id": 2, "time": "23000", "image": "engenn6le15ob02re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "The Galapagos Islands have fascinated scientists and adventurers for generations. How amazing would it be to take part in an expedition to this remote land?", "id": 3, "time": "55000", "image": "engenn6le15ob02re2img03.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le15ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le15ob02re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}